<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

  <body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="flex-fill d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center">

      <h1 class="mb-4"><%= title %></h1>

      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">

          <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
            <div class="bg-light p-5 rounded shadow h-100 text-center">
              <h2 class="mb-4">Breakpoints</h2>
              <p class="mb-0">
                Os breakpoints são larguras que determinam como o layout responsivo se comporta em diferentes dispositivos.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
            <div class="bg-light p-5 rounded shadow h-100 text-center">
              <h2 class="mb-4">Containers</h2>
              <p class="mb-0">
                Os containers são usados para centralizar e organizar o conteúdo dentro da aplicação.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
            <div class="bg-light p-5 rounded shadow h-100 text-center">
              <h2 class="mb-4">Grid System</h2>
              <p class="mb-0">
                O grid system permite criar layouts responsivos com base em 12 colunas.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="col-md-3 mb-4">
            <div class="bg-light p-5 rounded shadow h-100 text-center">
              <h2 class="mb-4">Gutters</h2>
              <p class="mb-0">
                As gutters são os espaços entre as colunas, usados ​​para espaçar e alinhar o conteúdo de forma responsiva no sistema de grade do Bootstrap.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  </body>
</html>
